I met two Eagle candidates the other night at a border review,

42
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:37,000
Two very different Scouts, both outstanding candidates.

43
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:40,000
Based on what I'm seeing at boards of review this year,

44
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:43,000
the future of America is in good hands,

45
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:45,000
Skip. I heartily agree

46
