00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:06,000
He coaches and serves as an advisor

286
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:08,000
to the scouts, but he leads adults.

287
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:10,000
When he tells adults what to do,

288
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:12,000
