308
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:52,000
not to pass judgment on

309
00:12:52,000 --> 00:12:54,000
the plans of the patrol leaders council-

310
00:12:54,000 --> 00:12:56,000
No votes, no picking things apart.

311
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:58,000
They find the way

312
00:12:58,000 --> 00:13:00,000
to make the patrol leaders council's

313
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:02,000
plans happen.

314
00:13:02,000 --> 00:13:04,000
Only one adult- and that will be you

315
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:06,000
as the scout master when you're there,

316
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:08,000
or the person you designate,

317
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:10,000
and that just needs to be one person-

318
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:12,000
interacts with

319
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:14,000
and directs the youth leadership during

320
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:16,000
